sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Update service
    participant H as Package host
    participant P as Candidate process
    participant S as Repository unit of work
    participant C as Calling services
    U->>U: Verify signature trust scope and provenance
    U->>H: Prepare immutable candidate version
    H->>P: Initialize without effect grants
    P-->>H: Negotiated protocol and registrations
    H->>H: Validate complete candidate registry
    H->>C: Gate new calls to affected instance
    H->>H: Drain pinned turns and resolve operations
    alt Barrier unavailable
        H-->>C: Reopen old version admission
        H-->>U: Keep update staged with backoff
    else Safe boundary available
        H->>S: Prepare unpublished state generation
        H->>S: CAS trust registry state and activation intent
        alt Revision or migration failure
            S-->>H: No publication
            H-->>C: Keep prior version active
        else Atomic commit succeeds
            S-->>H: Committed registry and state generation
            H->>P: Idempotent host.activate
            alt Ready
                P-->>H: Ready for committed generation
                H-->>C: Release calls on new version
            else Startup failure before work admitted
                H->>S: Guarded rollback to predecessor
                H-->>C: Restore prior coherent generation
            end
        end
    end
    Note over H,S: After work admission rollback must preserve new state and effects
